{"id": "WJ-068", "category_id": "defense", "category": "防守、站位、回防", "trigger": "重防猜对", "energy": 3, "text": "赌对了！{守方}直接在{进攻点}摆了三个人，{攻方}这一波要撞上一堵墙。", "source_type": "original_template", "verified_spoken_quote": false}
{"id": "WJ-069", "category_id": "defense", "category": "防守、站位、回防", "trigger": "重防猜错", "energy": 2, "text": "防守重心全部压错，{进攻点}一片空。现在他们只能赌回防速度和后点枪法了。", "source_type": "original_template", "verified_spoken_quote": false}
